    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 17 Lisheen Woods, is a superb four-bed, three-bath detached residence extending to c.142 sq. metres, ideally positioned in this attractive and well-established development of Lisheen Woods just west of Ballincollig. \r\n\r\nOffering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, with private rear garden to one side and landscaped garden to the other; this home is perfectly suited to modern family living. \r\n\r\nEnjoying a convenient location with easy access to the N22 link road, the property benefits from excellent connectivity to Ballincollig, Cork City and surrounding areas, while still offering the peace and privacy of a mature residential setting.\r\n\r\nViewing is a must!!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway & Foyer –  2.79m x 1.98m & 2.33m  1.98m \r\nContemporary tile flooring sets the tone for this inviting entrance hallway.  All accommodation is accessed from here including an understairs storage/ utility room which is plumbed for a washing machine. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.62 m x 1.30 m \r\nGuest bathroom with front aspect window and tiled flooring. WHB, W.C. \r\n\r\nLiving Room – 4.12 m X 3.76m \r\nAiry and relaxed living room with a bay window looking out to the front of the property. Featuring a modern inset gas fireplace and custom-built ins, adding a luxury touch. Double doors to the adjoining second reception room provide the opportunity to open up the space when entertaining.  \r\n\r\nSitting Room – 5.87m X 3.12m \r\nWhat every family is looking for – the second living space! \r\nWith laminate flooring and French door access to the secluded patio area outside, this practical, multi-purpose space can be used as a second sitting room, playroom or home office.  \r\n\r\nKitchen 3.44m  X 3.04m &  Dining – 3.04m X 2.64m \r\nA bright and beautifully presented contemporary kitchen and dining space, featuring sleek fitted cabinetry, generous worktop space and a range of integrated appliances; Neff oven/microwave stack and a Hotpoint gas hob. Large windows allow an abundance of natural light to fill the room, while the warm timber blinds and tiled flooring complement the clean, modern finish. The adjoining dining area provides an inviting space for everyday family dining or entertaining. A stylish, practical and wonderfully bright heart of the home.\r\n\r\nUtility Room – 3.04m x 0.93m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine/dryer & access to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUnderstairs Cloakroom/Storage – \r\nPractical storage room with tiled flooring, lighting & power outlets. \r\n\r\nStairs & Landing –  1.97m x 3.67m\r\nCarpeted stairs & landing lead to hot press, attic and all first-floor accommodation. Beautiful chandelier and feature lighting.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 1.97m X 1.72m \r\nA stylish and well-appointed family bathroom, finished with contemporary neutral tiling throughout. The room features a full-size bath with chrome fittings, modern vanity unit with wash-hand basin, WC, illuminated mirror and heated towel rail. A frosted window provides plenty of natural light while maintaining privacy, creating a bright, fresh and relaxing space.\r\n \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom & En-Suite (Bedroom 1) – 3.77m X 4.36m \r\nA bright and spacious master bedroom, beautifully presented with soft carpeting, mirrored fitted wardrobes providing excellent storage, and a large window enjoying a pleasant leafy outlook. \r\n\r\nThe adjoining en-suite is finished with contemporary tiling and features a generous shower enclosure, modern vanity unit, WC and illuminated mirror.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2  -  3.10m X 3.04m \r\nDouble bedroom with front aspect bay window. Built in wardrobes and laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3  -  3.21m X 3.19m\r\nBright double bedroom with built in wardrobes and laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4  -  3.03m X 3.02m\r\nBright double bedroom with Built in wardrobes and laminate flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGarden Details \r\nTo the front, a cobble-lock driveway provides ample off-street parking, while a small grass area with attractive shrubbery to the side adds further greenery to the property. To the rear, the attractive garden offers a wonderful mix of lawn and patio space, complemented by a garden shed providing useful additional storage. \r\n\r\nA generous, paved patio adjoining the house is ideal for al fresco dining, entertaining and relaxing outdoors. With direct access from the house, the garden provides a private and versatile outdoor space perfect for both family life and entertaining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A Rated Home\r\nSuperb location close to bus route and Ballincollig Town Centre. \r\nTurnkey condition inside and out! Ready for immediate occupation\r\nLarge patio perfect for al fresco dining.\r\nPristine shed with& lighting."
      },
